 ✓\n\n총 48개 테스트 통과. 규칙 1-28 모두 완전 검증됨.\n\n다음 단계로 진행 가능.\n","userModified":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"de300f57-a25f-4ff9-ac47-05d7e97f0091","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/incognito/dev/projects/palimpsest-agent-laziness","sessionId":"34d9dd87-316d-46cf-89ff-ac02b41e62ea","version":"2.1.241","gitBranch":"round/agent-laziness"}
